>
  <main id="main" class="section-pad">
    <div class="container not-found">
      <p class="eyebrow">404 — page not found</p>
      <h1>This one has<br /><em>moved on.</em></h1>
      <p class="not-found-lede">The page you were after has moved, been renamed, or never existed. No stress — the yard is still right where you left it.</p>
      <div class="not-found-actions">
        <a class="button button-bright" href="/services/">See what we store <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Read from the yard <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="not-found-help">Need a hand? Call <a href="tel:098184586">09 818 4586</a> or <a href="/contact/">send us an enquiry</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</PageLayout>
